-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data and models (downloaded separately with `medmereport models pull`,
not stored in this repository)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SynthSeg 2.0 (whole-brain, parcellation and robust models)
  B. Billot et al. "SynthSeg: Segmentation of brain MRI scans of any
  contrast and resolution without retraining." Medical Image Analysis, 2023.
  Robust/parcellation models: B. Billot et al., PNAS, 2023.
  https://github.com/BBillot/SynthSeg - Apache License 2.0.
  MODIFIED: the original Keras/TensorFlow (.h5) weights were converted to ONNX
  (opset 17) by scripts/convert_synthseg.py for CPU inference without TensorFlow.
  The numerical behaviour was checked against the original (argmax agreement 1.0
  on the validation input). The converted files are published as release assets
  under the tag `models-synthseg-2.0`.

TotalSegmentator (open task "total", fast 3 mm model)
  J. Wasserthal et al. "TotalSegmentator: Robust Segmentation of 104 Anatomic
  Structures in CT Images." Radiology: Artificial Intelligence, 2023.
  https://github.com/wasserth/TotalSegmentator - Apache License 2.0 (open tasks
  only; licensed tasks are not used).

